<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria 96 dividend 12 ATS/share.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria 96 dividend 12 ATS/share.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria, the country's top bank, said on Thursday it would pay a 1996 dividend of 12 schillings per share, up from 10 schillings a year earlier.  </p>
<p>The group last week reported a surprise 39 percent drop in 1996 net profit to 1.587 billion schillings. First quarter operating profit, consolidated for the first time to include schillings.</p>
<p>Bank Austria acquired the state's majority voting stake in Creditanstalt in January for 17 billion schillings in cash. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
